#
# AArch64 does not use segmentation or a GDT. This module provides API-compatible
# data structures and constants that map to the AArch64 exception level model.
# GdtEntry stores exception level configuration attributes, Gdt manages a set of
# entries, and the selector constants map to EL0/EL1 privilege boundaries.
